    "closeModal calls dialog.close; the existing close listener invalidates request tokens, clears pending debounce timer, removes data-search-modal-open and restores the connected opener/fallback button. Pending search callbacks already check dialog.open/request token, so the new branch reuses the reviewed cancellation/focus lifecycle. It does not modify query parsing, rankings, URLs, locale selection, content, metadata or SDK behavior.",
    "Exact text comparison removes only the six added lines and recovers the prior immutable source bytes. Every other final-34 input snapshot file is checked unchanged. This is targeted independent source reasoning; no Chrome, browser, search, build or SDK execution was performed by this reviewer. Other agents own the reported browser regression/verification."
